      "title": "Vibe Coding on Medplum",
      "summary": "More and more Medplum users are building with AI coding assistants — Cursor, Claude, Copilot, and others. We have been talking to users about what works and wrote up what we have learned in a new guide: Building on Medplum with AI Coding Assistants. This post is the short version of what is in there.",
