      "title": "Medplum Achieves HITRUST e1 Certification",
      "summary": "Demonstrating commitment to cybersecurity and information protection: HITRUST Certification validates the Medplum Platform is meeting rigorous cybersecurity and data protection standards through independent assessment and assurance.",
